ood_lost","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"36"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"c833d277-1ada-48de-8849-de830c2b99b2","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"%lender","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"38"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"3531fac7-d7b9-44d9-b3bf-a0438795cb51","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"38"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"40"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"0c35e5c5-95c7-43cb-a55a-9fa289041acf","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"40"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"42"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"a2a78fd1-0540-403d-a55d-b72682feb116","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"%lender_lost","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"44"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"816122d9-f604-4296-a643-6dea6ad361aa","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"44"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"46"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"5b1c5cdf-10fe-488d-9177-3d353f22c4a5","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"%price","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"48"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"d1ba8f29-91f0-472b-af8c-72dc14b251ac","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"48"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"50"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"0f8dc540-3ec8-4a7a-bdc1-25b0b31334c0","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"%outlaw_paid","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"52"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"341f9e8e-3258-422f-9fc6-dae79eecaa74","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"%outlaw_seized","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"54"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"7cb98158-dd83-4fcd-8c6c-1907b65300ab","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"%let_lie","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"56"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"d94b5709-6ebc-46bf-8d5a-4a2a487e993a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"answer","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"selector","guid":"1eb60004-f961-4c5c-87c0-60e9b7b22526","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-90.0,"xMax":2900.0,"yMax":2250.0},"label":"She answers","comment":"Over him she says what is to be done (swear his blood, take it to the count, or say nothing); then where he lies; then blood or silver, or the lender himself; and an outlaw''s dealings with the count.","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"d0a0b4bb-6e51-4616-94d8-acef694c03b9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":420.0,"xMax":380.0,"yMax":840.0},"title":"The answers","body":"swear: she swears his blood.\nlaw: she takes it to the count.\nquiet: she says nothing.\nbury_priest, pyre, bury_water: where he is laid.\nbury_aboard: carried aboard, for a fire on a shore.\nblood: she has killed the one who did it.\nblood_lost: that fight went against her.\nlender: she has killed the lender.\nlender_lost: she was thrown out of his house.\nprice: the count sets his price on the lender.\noutlaw_paid, outlaw_seized: an outlaw before the count''s men.\nlet_lie: she said nothing, and the days ran out.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"664bc6f3-2b19-4ada-b447-c35cc1248670","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":880.0,"xMax":380.0,"yMax":1180.0},"title":"The numbers, and what is said","body":"How much the crew''s heart rises, the fines and the prices are the table''s (Game/Data/feud_rules_793.json). How a fight goes is the card''s own chance, carried by \"Rule - how a fight stands\". What a part has to say of what happened is put into the card''s end, in the order the parts run. PLACEHOLDER WORDS, in Feud.cs: the user''s to write.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"f421e275-b30e-4b17-beea-ddeae8bb0689","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":1220.0,"xMax":380.0,"yMax":1480.0},"title":"What is not here","body":"WHEN each card is put before her (over him; the one who did it, when the rope men next come; where he lies; a shore for his fire) is the code''s, by the table''s numbers (Feud.Step). The punishment that falls at his death (a man fewer, the crew''s heart, the mark on her) falls before his scene, in the code (Feud.RavnKilled).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"0f115e48-c66f-408c-bdf2-eedf957edaf3","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
